{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature.\n\nHaving unraveled the secrets of time magic, chronomancy, you have learned to pull seconds apart, reorder them, and reap minutes as a reward. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- All spells with the Chronomancy tag are added to your class’s spell list, if they are a level for which your class gets spell slots. Use your spellcasting ability for these spells.\n\n- You learn the Moment to Think cantrip, which doesn’t count against your total number of cantrips known.\n\n- Choose a number of spells equal to your proficiency bonus that have the Chronomancy tag from levels for which you have spell slots. You always have those spells prepared, and you can cast them with any spell slots you have. The spells\u0027 spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat. Whenever your proficiency bonus increases thereafter, you can add an additional spell with the Chronomancy tag to the spells always prepared with this feature.","level":1}],"id":"Customf74d1174-c39b-4613-bcd9-03533f5862a1","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Chronomancy Initiate [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}